{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"cart\"><items/></data>\n    <data id=\"total\" expr=\"0\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <assign location=\"$cart/items\" type=\"addattribute\" expr=\"'x'\"/>\n      <assign location=\"$cart/items\" attr=\"count\" expr=\"1\"/>\n      <assign location=\"$total\"/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":3,"notes":0,"total":3,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":287,"endColumn":68,"endLine":8,"startColumn":68,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":" attr=\"…\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add the `attr` to set"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":56,"endLine":8,"startColumn":44,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<assign type=\"addattribute\">` names no attribute: `attr` is missing\n\n**Note:** `type=\"addattribute\"` adds an attribute to the selected element, so `attr` must name it; the value comes from `expr` or the child content\n\n**Help:** add `attr=\"name\"` with the attribute to add\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.6 <assign>","text":"`<assign type=\"addattribute\">` names no attribute: `attr` is missing"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":275,"start":263},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML065"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":13,"byteOffset":326,"endColumn":50,"endLine":9,"startColumn":37,"startLine":9},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `attr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":50,"endLine":9,"startColumn":38,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`attr` on `<assign>` is used only with `type=\"addattribute\"`\n\n**Note:** only `type=\"addattribute\"` adds an attribute named by `attr`; every other placement replaces or inserts nodes, so `attr` would be ignored\n\n**Help:** remove `attr`, or set `type=\"addattribute\"` to add that attribute\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.6 <assign>","text":"`attr` on `<assign>` is used only with `type=\"addattribute\"`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":339,"start":327},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML065"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":382,"endColumn":32,"endLine":10,"startColumn":32,"startLine":10},"insertedContent":{"text":" expr=\"…\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add the `expr` to assign"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":14,"endLine":10,"startColumn":8,"startLine":10}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<assign>` has no value\n\n**Note:** `<assign>` stores a value at `location`, taken from `expr` or from its child content; without either there is nothing to assign\n\n**Help:** add `expr` with the value to assign, or give the value as child content\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.4 <assign>","text":"`<assign>` has no value"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":364,"start":358},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML065"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<assign>` stores the value of `expr` or of its child content at `location` (SCXML 1.0 §5.4); the XPath placements (SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.6) add the attribute named by `attr` only for `type=\"addattribute\"`, and a `type=\"delete\"` ignores its value (\"('expr' is ignored.)\"); the compiler rejects an `<assign>` with nothing to store other than a deletion, and `attr` without `addattribute` or the reverse"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: give the `<assign>` an `expr` (or child content); use `attr` exactly with `type=\"addattribute\"`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.4 <assign>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML065` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#assign","id":"SCXML065","name":"SCXML065","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `<assign>` has no value, or its value does not fit its `type`"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}